From 54a28ef46333aaf9d6c8df170b502eeec34117b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: StudyFlow merge <merge@studyflow.local>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 05:28:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Outline parser v2 and inline course creation

- Multiple instructor candidates with roles and sections; student picks one
- Weekly recurring meetings with RRULE, day ranges, dated-schedule folding
- Weights only from the grading section; bonus/dropped excluded; verified
  against 100% with explicit confirmation when over
- Section-aware noise filtering (office hours, textbooks, policies)
- Four-step import confirmation: course & instructor, schedule, assessment
  scheme, confirm
- Add an assessment and create its course in the same step
